#: scenario5:scenario5_4A897F4C_E0E2_415A_A9A0_1CCB1D2596EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa663ffabc86bf90576540ea22a31ce08729ff6ac4d192e14e0bbd422ac6b653
