msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Last year, I requested flower seeds.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But I just couldn’t get them to grow,⟪k:3⟫and "
"I was starting to think they never would..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No ano passado, pedi sementes de flores.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mas eu simplesmente não conseguia fazê-las "
"crescer,⟪k:3⟫e eu estava começando a pensar que elas nunca iriam..."

