#: scenario5:scenario5_B595E7DD_16E6_4193_8F62_1AA39B0F2F5E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f91e036d899caeec57a2b95c967540615416de43270c7702b491531fbf9ddfef
