msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No... ⟪k:1⟫that’s not what I meant. ⟪k:2⟫Why ⟪k:3⟫me⟪k:4⟫?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I haven’t given you "
"anything..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não... ⟪k:1⟫não foi o que eu quis dizer. ⟪k:2⟫Por que para ⟪k:3⟫mim⟪k:4⟫?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Eu não te "
"dei nada..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_98B059F8_2C14_45D6_A5F8_BA68EBCD10C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a5cab7ddad36b5ebeb7082cea36d59ec251c4b3d14b26790bbfb1e12b353d04
